{"id":"9e7e983eeefce662","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy.md","title":"多步函数策略的正规化","display":"df-many-step-normalizing-strategy — 多步函数策略的正规化","type":"definition","metadata":{"book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","type":"definition","label":"56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy","aliases":["56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy"],"display":"df-many-step-normalizing-strategy — 多步函数策略的正规化","depends_on":["[[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]","[[56-df-normalizing-strategy]]","[[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]"],"source_section":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.2(i)","source_printed_pages":"130","source_ocr_blocks":[151],"source_verification":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-many-step-normalizing-strategy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-many-step-normalizing-strategy — 多步函数策略的正规化"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"bb3bb78c5caf074d\" href=\"?note=bb3bb78c5caf074d\" title=\"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy\">56-df-many-step-functional-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"6a238253009869a2\" href=\"?note=6a238253009869a2\" title=\"56-df-normalizing-strategy\">56-df-normalizing-strategy</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"049c0e933557b214\" href=\"?note=049c0e933557b214\" title=\"56-df-weakly-normalizing\">56-df-weakly-normalizing</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§4.9 Definition 4.9.2(i)"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"130"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>151</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"已据本地DjVu提取文本核对对应段落；本节点的独立论证与核验边界见Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 为集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\to\\subseteq A^2\">\\(\\to\\subseteq A^2\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\\in A^A\">\\(F\\in A^A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{FunctionalReductionStrategy}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F^{[n]}\">\\(F^{[n]}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"bb3bb78c5caf074d\" href=\"?note=bb3bb78c5caf074d\" title=\"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy\">56-df-many-step-functional-strategy</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{WNAt}\">\\(\\mathrm{WNAt}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"049c0e933557b214\" href=\"?note=049c0e933557b214\" title=\"56-df-weakly-normalizing\">56-df-weakly-normalizing</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}\">\\(\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NF}\">\\(\\mathrm{NF}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6a238253009869a2\" href=\"?note=6a238253009869a2\" title=\"56-df-normalizing-strategy\">56-df-normalizing-strategy</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ManyStepNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,F^{[n]}(a))\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ManyStepNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{ManyStepReductionStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\land\n\\forall a\\in A\\;\\bigl(\\mathrm{WNAt}(A,\\to,a)\\Longrightarrow\n\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\mathrm{NF}(A,\\to,F^{[n]}(a))\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FunctionalNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ManyStepNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{FunctionalNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\n\\mathrm{NormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F)\\lor\n\\mathrm{ManyStepNormalizingStrategy}(A,\\to,F).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>只要求对存在正规形的起点在有限次策略迭代后成功；不会把非正规化项强行要求为策略终止。多步调用内部的每段有限非空归约与策略调用次数是两个层次。本节点补足既有一步正规化策略接口，定义没有引入对无限归约的选择。</p>\n<p>来源的OCR页块序号按本地提取文本中的分页符编号，不等同于DjVu物理页码。本轮未作机器证明；计算性未编码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"bb3bb78c5caf074d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-many-step-functional-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-normalizing-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"6a238253009869a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-normalizing-strategy]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-weakly-normalizing","status":"resolved","id":"049c0e933557b214","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-weakly-normalizing]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-many-step-functional-strategy","status":"resolved","id":"bb3